<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat does not trade for second day.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat does not trade for second day.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian wheat futures did not trade on Thursday for the second successive day.</p>
<p>Settlement prices were mostly steady.</p>
<p>Kerrin Gleeson of Elders Risk Management Pty Ltd pointed to an absence of news which might affect the market, saying even U.S. markets were lacklustre.</p>
<p>Talk of Australian interest in selling wheat to Egypt and India, together with the Australian Wheat Board's full programme of sales, were helping support the market, she said.  </p>
